#. Global message key: motto1
#: src/sections/traditions.html:6
msgctxt "text:motto1"
msgid "Cross borders in pursuit of truth;"
msgstr "越境求真，"

#. Global message key: motto2
#: src/sections/traditions.html:6
msgctxt "text:motto2"
msgid "contest ideas with respect."
msgstr "以禮交鋒。"

#. Global message key: mottoBody
#: src/sections/about.html:21
msgctxt "text:mottoBody"
msgid ""
"A barrier is not the end of knowledge. Every crossing must leave behind "
"traceable observations and a clear account of responsibility."
msgstr "不把結界當作知識的終點。每一次跨越，都要留下可追溯的觀察與責任。"

