msgstr "符卡口試需要戰鬥嗎？"

#. Global message key: mindReading
#: src/sections/faq.html:31
msgctxt "text:mindReading"
msgid "Are interviews or mind-reading unrestricted on campus?"
msgstr "校內可以自由採訪或讀心嗎？"

#. Global message key: faqAnswerNoAbility
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:faqAnswerNoAbility"
msgid ""
"Yes. General entry values your question, observation method, readiness to "
"collaborate, and risk judgment. An ability is assessed only if you choose it "
"as a research method."
msgstr "可以。一般選拔重視問題意識、觀察方法、合作準備與風險判斷；能力只在你選擇把它作為研究方法時才納入評估。"

#. Global message key: faqAnswerBarrier
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:faqAnswerBarrier"
msgid ""
"After admission, the admissions office assigns a Hakurei Gate crossing time. "
"Arrive at the designated entrance, do not search for a gap yourself, and "
"register Outside World electronics in advance."
msgstr "錄取後由招生諮詢室安排博麗門通行時刻。請依通知抵達指定入口，不要自行尋找裂隙；行李中的外界電器需先登記。"

#. Global message key: faqAnswerSpell
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:faqAnswerSpell"
msgid ""
"Firepower does not decide admission. The topic, limits, stop conditions, and "
"safety distance are published in advance, and non-danmaku formats are "
"available."
msgstr "不以火力決定錄取。口試採符卡規則：題目、限制、終止條件與安全距離都會事先公開，也可申請非彈幕形式。"

#. Global message key: faqAnswerMind
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:faqAnswerMind"
msgid ""
"No. Interviews, photography, mind-reading, sensory guidance, and historical "
"abilities require consent under course or research rules. A public space is "
"not a waiver of privacy."
msgstr "不可以。採訪、攝影、讀心、感覺誘導與歷史能力都需要依課程或研究規範取得同意；公共區域也不等於放棄隱私。"

#. Global message key: closing1
#: src/sections/about.html:6
