#: src/sections/faq.html:32
msgctxt "text:ethicsAnswer"
msgid ""
"No. Interviews, photography, mind-reading, wavelength interference, and "
"historical manipulation are governed by research ethics. Being able to do "
"something is not consent."
msgstr "不可以。採訪、攝影、讀心、波長干預與歷史操作都受研究倫理規範；能做到一件事，不等於得到同意。"

