msgid "Unidentified Flying Object Society"
msgstr "不明飛行物觀測會"

#. Global message key: spellAnswer
#: src/sections/faq.html:25
msgctxt "text:spellAnswer"
msgid ""
"No. It borrows a structure with a name, rules, and a way out for debating "
"ideas. Firepower is not tested, and abilities may not interfere with "
"judging."
msgstr "不需要。它借用「有名稱、有規則、有退路」的結構進行觀點答辯，不測火力，也禁止以能力干預評審。"

